From 78cdf4ec6727c288df2565dc6622ebf8ec0dd51e Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: bupd <bupdprasanth@gmail.com>
Date: Mon, 3 Mar 2025 19:13:47 +0530
Subject: [PATCH] feat(ldap): add admin group filter

Add LDAP admin group filter configuration option that allows
administrators to specify a filter for identifying admin users
via LDAP group membership.

This enables automatic admin role assignment for users matching
the configured LDAP group filter.

Signed-off-by: bupd <bupdprasanth@gmail.com>
